message: "If you use this research, please cite this archived version."
title: "The parity spectrum of nonantipodal odd-harmonic designs"
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "Classifies all cardinalities of nonantipodal spherical designs with prescribed odd harmonic vanishing through order 2m-1. The minimum even cardinality is 4m+2 on a circle and 4m in ambient dimension at least three. In dimension six and higher the same spectrum follows from the highest odd degree alone."
